          "changeMeaning": "Introduce the starry backdrop and the initial apparent position of Mars drifting eastward.",
          "narration": "Welcome to the retrograde motion lab. Normally, as we watch Mars from Earth night after night, it appears to drift slowly eastward against the background stars. This is called prograde motion."
