                    255,
                    255
                  ],
                  "fontSize": 32
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "changeMeaning": "Animate Mars entering its backward retrograde loop.",
          "narration": "However, every 26 months, Mars slows down, stops its eastward journey, and reverses westward for about two months, tracing a beautiful loop before turning back eastward."
        },
