          "changeMeaning": "Highlight the challenge this presented to ancient astronomers, preparing transition to the Geocentric model.",
          "narration": "For ancient astronomers who believed Earth was at the absolute center of the universe, this looping motion was a monumental puzzle. Let's look at how they tried to explain it."
